# 🔌 Wiring

## 🖥️ ST7735 1.8" TFT → Arduino Uno

| TFT Pin | Arduino Uno |
|---|---|
| VCC | 5V* |
| GND | GND |
| CS | D10 |
| RESET | D8 |
| A0 / DC | D9 |
| SDA / MOSI | D11 |
| SCK | D13 |
| LED | 5V* |

> ⚠️ Check the voltage requirements of your exact TFT module before using 5V. Some ST7735 boards require 3.3V.

---

## ↔️ Left/Right Servo → Arduino Uno

This servo controls the **horizontal scanning axis**.

| Servo Wire | Connection |
|---|---|
| Signal (orange/yellow) | D5 |
| VCC (red) | External 5V |
| GND (brown/black) | External GND |

---

## ↕️ Up/Down Servo → Arduino Uno

This servo controls the **vertical scanning axis**.

| Servo Wire | Connection |
|---|---|
| Signal (orange/yellow) | D6 |
| VCC (red) | External 5V |
| GND (brown/black) | External GND |

---

## 📡 HC-SR04 → Arduino Uno

| HC-SR04 Pin | Arduino Uno |
|---|---|
| VCC | 5V |
| GND | GND |
| TRIG | D7 |
| ECHO | D4 |

---

# ⚡ Power Wiring

The servos should be powered from a separate 5V supply.

```text
             External 5V
                 │
          ┌──────┴──────┐
          │             │
      Servo 1 VCC    Servo 2 VCC
          │             │
          └─────────────┘

External GND
     │
     ├── Servo 1 GND
     ├── Servo 2 GND
     │
     └── Arduino GND
